{"id":"6d855f50cfaeb981","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-open-formula.md","title":"Open Formula","display":"df-open-formula — Open Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-open-formula","aliases":["92-df-open-formula"],"display":"df-open-formula — Open Formula","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]"],"source":"本地算术语法；对照原书第 II 章 pp.14–19 和第 III 章 pp.28–30；本库 token 编码及 Hilbert 呈现与原书原生语言不同","source_status":"原书相关概念的本地语法实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-open-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-open-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-open-formula — Open Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地算术语法；对照原书第 II 章 pp.14–19 和第 III 章 pp.28–30；本库 token 编码及 Hilbert 呈现与原书原生语言不同"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关概念的本地语法实现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Open}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Open}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{Open}_G(\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\neq\\emptyset\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{Open}_G(\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\neq\\emptyset\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开公式：含自由变量的公式</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi) \\neq \\emptyset\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi) \\neq \\emptyset\\)</span></li>\n<li>例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sx = Sy\">\\(Sx = Sy\\)</span></li>\n<li>开公式定义关系而非命题</li>\n<li>可通过量化封闭成句子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x \\forall y(Sx = Sy \\to x = y)\">\\(\\forall x \\forall y(Sx = Sy \\to x = y)\\)</span></li>\n<li>开公式是谓词的语法表示</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FV}_G$ (free-variable function, see [[92-df-free-variable-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Open}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{Open}_G(\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\neq\\emptyset","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi) \\neq \\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"Sx = Sy","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x \\forall y(Sx = Sy \\to x = y)","display":false}],"bytes":1128,"backlinks":[{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-open-formula]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-open-formula]]"}],"outgoing":["5a1bd470754681a7","b9e3d57e94ce36b7"]}